OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fvery warm evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Overnight will remain warm
OL,8,Fwith light winds, leading to an
OL,9,Funcomfortable night for sleeping.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,12,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,13,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,14,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,15,Fcome the afternoon. Feeling a little
OL,16,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
