OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry throughout the weekend with a mix
OL,7,Fof cloud and sunshine. Monday is
OL,8,Flikely to remain dry although rain may
OL,9,Fmove in later. Temperatures returning
OL,10,Fto nearer average.
